' A room opens on its first page (`InventoryWindow.SetGroup`:
' `activePageIndex = 0`, the group's members in range in order,
' GUI/InventoryWindow.cs:145-201), whoever went in: run with `preset
' classic ai none seed 3 start 30 party` (the leader and one companion
' handed over, a prepared state). In Paradise Camp the group walks up to
' the tent; the companion is selected alone and sent in; the leader
' stands within range, so the room shows the leader's page in front
' (page 1), not the companion's.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
mapclick 170,175         ' the group, up to the tent
wait 90
press shift+right        ' the companion, alone
mapclick 177,150         ' the tent: he walks there and goes in
wait 120
snap room_first_page
quit
